abstract: >-
  SimPy model of an agentic security operations center in which a deterministic gateway issues
  evidence-bound action warrants, a reference implementation of the gateway core (Ed25519-signed
  single-use expiring warrants, masking Byzantine quorum reads, enforcement point), and EBAW-SOC-Synth,
  a synthetic dataset of 900 agentic response episodes and 6300 proposals with the record schema
  proposed in the accompanying article submitted to Inventions (MDPI). Includes a self-contained
  Google Colab notebook. Reproduces all results of the article. All data are synthetic.
